  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/09/IMG_1309.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La comisi&oacute;n de fiestas (foto) de la calle Monse&ntilde;or Fernando Ferr&iacute;s y adyacentes,&nbsp;en Onda, ha organizado&nbsp;un fin de semana cultural que ha servido de precalentamiento para el retorno de los festejos al barrio, previsto para mayo de 2015. Ha habido cena de sobaquillo, bingos, actuaci&oacute;n del grupo Lat&iacute;n Rumba, juegos infantiles y concurso de paellas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesculturalsmonsenyorfernandoferris/img_0918.jpg\" alt=\"img_0918\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesculturalsmonsenyorfernandoferris/img_0919.jpg\" alt=\"img_0919\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesculturalsmonsenyorfernandoferris/img_0921.jpg\" alt=\"img_0921\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesculturalsmonsenyorfernandoferris/img_0922.jpg\" alt=\"img_0922\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesculturalsmonsenyorfernandoferris/img_0923.jpg\" alt=\"img_0923\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesculturalsmonsenyorfernandoferris/img_0925.jpg\" alt=\"img_0925\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesculturalsmonsenyorfernandoferris/img_0926.jpg\" alt=\"img_0926\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesculturalsmonsenyorfernandoferris/img_0927.jpg\" alt=\"img_0927\" s